{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024580/extras/04ff0799bc95a2e380f3280b34493f64.poster.avif?t=1771956121\" width=1024 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024580/extras/04ff0799bc95a2e380f3280b34493f64.webm?t=1771956121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024580/extras/04ff0799bc95a2e380f3280b34493f64.mp4?t=1771956121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Don\u2019t Eat Me, Granny - a cartoon-styled horror game where dark fantasy comes alive. You play as a boy kidnapped by a creepy grandma and find yourself in a world where past and present intertwine. Hide, solve puzzles, travel through portals, and uncover the hidden truths of this bizarre place before it swallows you forever.<br><br><strong>Two times \u2014 one reality.</strong> Switch between past and present to solve puzzles and find your path to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024580/extras/ed95ec1e404878ab30ddeac52fcb932a.poster.avif?t=1771956121\" width=1024 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024580/extras/ed95ec1e404878ab30ddeac52fcb932a.webm?t=1771956121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024580/extras/ed95ec1e404878ab30ddeac52fcb932a.mp4?t=1771956121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Cartoon dark fantasy.</strong> A unique visual style that blends fairytale and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p